       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. MULTIPLY-DIVIDE.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 FIRST-NUMBER PIC 999 VALUE 25.
       01 SECOND-NUMBER PIC 999 VALUE 4.
       01 PRODUCT PIC 9(5) VALUE 0.
       01 QUOTIENT PIC 999 VALUE 0.
       01 REMAINDER-VALUE PIC 999 VALUE 0.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MULTIPLY FIRST-NUMBER BY SECOND-NUMBER
               GIVING PRODUCT.
           DISPLAY "PRODUCT: " PRODUCT.
           DIVIDE FIRST-NUMBER BY SECOND-NUMBER
               GIVING QUOTIENT REMAINDER REMAINDER-VALUE.
           DISPLAY "QUOTIENT: " QUOTIENT.
           DISPLAY "REMAINDER: " REMAINDER-VALUE.
           STOP RUN.
